                ],
                [
                    915.0,
                    512.0
                ],
                [
                    915.0,
                    688.0
                ],
                [
                    510.0,
                    688.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "To function accurately, a lathe regardless of size, or weight must be perfectly level before being placed in use. It is the purpose of the leveling process to relieve strains and distortion and restore the bed to the plane in which it was scraped.",
            "block_bbox": [
